---
description: Flutter testing conventions
globs: flutter_app/**/test/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Use flutter_test + mocktail + riverpod_test. Mock repositories at the
provider boundary — never hit a real network in a test. Override providers
via ProviderScope overrides, not global state mutation.

Every new Failure subtype or FailureCode needs a corresponding equality/
mapping test. Every new repository method needs a test proving transport
exceptions are mapped to Failure and never leaked.
